# ID: DSA-050
# Category: math
# Algorithm: factorial table with signed 64-bit wraparound
# Exercises: integer overflow wrap (L37), running product, output of negative wrapped values
# Difficulty: medium
# Expected: n! for n = 1..25, with n! >= 21 wrapping modulo 2^64 as signed
int f
f lo 1 pettu
prati i 1 nundi 26 varaku {
    f lo f * i pettu
    f ni chupi
}
